      "facts": [
        "Trusted server-to-server header. Only the Codebuff API may honor this when the request authenticates as the Freebuff Web service account; browser and normal API callers must not be able to select another user's session row."
      ],
      "title": "Shared/Core update: free-agents",
      "summary": "Shared/Core changes across 2 file(s) (+62/−2).",
      "tags": [],
      "prevSha": "633c256122a18c49ab89171fbcf977a4370c4658",
